      ~Distributed File System Tools (dfsutil.exe) - DFS administration
      ~Windows Diagnostic Tools (msdt.exe) - Troubleshooting utilities
      ~Network Shell (netsh.exe) - Network configuration
      ~Shared Folder Tools (net share, shrpubw.exe) - Share management
      ~Unix Network Commands (ifconfig, ip) - Interface configuration
      ~Windows Backup Utilities (wbadmin.exe) - Backup operations
      ~Authentication Tools (runas.exe) - Privilege execution
      ~System File Checker (sfc.exe) - System file verification
