    Browser Security Tools - Extensions and software for web browser manipulation
      ~Deploy Burp Suite proxy to intercept and modify browser traffic, test web applications, and identify security vulnerabilities through automated scanning
      ~Use Browser Developer Tools to analyze web application structure, modify JavaScript code, and manipulate DOM elements in real-time
      ~Install and configure FoxyProxy for dynamic proxy switching and traffic routing through multiple proxy servers
      ~Deploy Cookie Editor extension to create, modify, and steal authentication tokens and session cookies
      ~Implement User-Agent Switcher to bypass browser fingerprinting and modify browser identification
