      ~Use Tamper Data to intercept and modify HTTP/HTTPS headers and request parameters
      ~Deploy ModHeader to modify browser headers for authentication bypass and security control evasion
      ~Deploy WebScarab for intercepting and recording all browser communications, including websockets and custom protocols
      ~Use Browser Password Dump tools to extract stored credentials from browser password managers
