      ~BlackLotus: First UEFI bootkit capable of bypassing UEFI Secure Boot
      ~TrickBot TR: UEFI/BIOS firmware module used for persistence
      ~FinSpy: Bootkit component targeting UEFI systems
      ~ThinkPwn: Exploits vulnerabilities in Lenovo UEFI firmware
      ~DerStarke: UEFI firmware implant attributed to CIA operations
      ~RomeoWhiskey: UEFI implant used for persistence and stealth
