    IoT Malware: Malware targeting Internet of Things devices
      ~Mirai: Botnet malware targeting IoT devices using default credentials, known for large-scale DDoS attacks
      ~BrickerBot: IoT malware designed to permanently disable (brick) vulnerable devices through destructive attacks
      ~Hajime: Peer-to-peer IoT botnet malware competing with Mirai, spreads via credential bruteforce
