      ~Torii: Sophisticated IoT botnet malware with multiple persistence mechanisms and data exfiltration capabilities
      ~Reaper (IoTroop): IoT botnet malware exploiting multiple vulnerabilities in various IoT devices
      ~Bashlite (Gafgyt): IoT malware family targeting Linux-based systems for DDoS attacks
